{"actions":[{"actionCode":"H11100","actionDate":"2025-01-16","source":"House floor actions","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Natural Resources.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"Intro-H","actionDate":"2025-01-16","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"1000","actionDate":"2025-01-16","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"}],"congress":119,"congressGovUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/526","cosponsors":[{"bioguideId":"P000048","fullName":"Rep. Pfluger, August [R-TX-11]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"},{"bioguideId":"W000814","fullName":"Rep. Weber, Randy K. Sr. [R-TX-14]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"},{"bioguideId":"B001317","fullName":"Rep. Brecheen, Josh [R-OK-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OK"},{"bioguideId":"H001096","fullName":"Rep. Hageman, Harriet M. [R-WY-At Large]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WY"},{"bioguideId":"M001228","fullName":"Rep. Maloy, Celeste [R-UT-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"UT"},{"bioguideId":"W000816","fullName":"Rep. Williams, Roger [R-TX-25]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"},{"bioguideId":"M000871","fullName":"Rep. Mann, Tracey [R-KS-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-21","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"KS"},{"bioguideId":"G000603","fullName":"Rep. Gill, Brandon [R-TX-26]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-21","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T19:07:21+00:00","id":"hr526-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-16","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-01-16","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Natural Resources."},"laws":[],"number":"526","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Energy","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"O000175","district":5,"fullName":"Rep. Ogles, Andrew [R-TN-5]","party":"R","state":"TN"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-16","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Declaration of Energy Independence Act</strong></p><p>This bill reduces certain royalty rates, minimum bids, rental rates, and fees for onshore oil and gas leases on federal lands&nbsp;and modifies related leasing procedures.</p><p>Specifically, the bill (1) decreases the royalty rate from 16 2/3% to 12 1/2% for&nbsp;developing oil and gas on federal lands, (2) lowers the minimum bid amount from $10.00 to $2.00 per acre for oil and gas leases on federal lands, and (3) decreases the rental rates from a maximum of $15.00 per acre to $1.50 per acre for the first five years and $2.00 per acre thereafter.&nbsp;The bill&nbsp;also eliminates the fee for expressing interest in a lease.&nbsp;</p><p>It also modifies&nbsp;leasing procedures to provide for noncompetitive leasing&nbsp;under certain circumstances.</p><p>In addition, the bill modifies the conditions&nbsp;for the reinstatement of leases that have been cancelled or terminated, including by reducing the applicable royalty and rental rates.</p>","updateDate":"2025-12-17T15:21:06Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Declaration of Energy Independence Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2025-12-17T15:22:45Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2025-12-17T15:22:45Z"}
